OL,3,AFrom dancing on the Tube to being      
OL,4,Asectioned: Sabrina Bahsoon on her      
OL,5,Apsychosis misdiagnosis                 
OL,7,FSabrina Bahsoon became known globally  
OL,8,Fas Tube Girl after self-shot videos of 
OL,9,Fher dancing and lip-syncing on the     
OL,10,FLondon Underground blew up online.     
OL,12,FThe 26-year-old content creator had the
OL,13,Fworld at her feet when she went viral  
OL,14,Fin 2023, going on to build a social    
OL,15,Fmedia following of more than 900,000   
OL,16,Fpeople.                                
OL,18,FShe signed major brand endorsement     
OL,19,Fdeals and was pursuing a music career. 
